000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329731:1","title":"相信技术的力量 - RSAC 2020 (2)","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329731&idx=1&sn=8a06ab5668d2903786eb8e31eff96a97&chksm=80ee4abeb799c3a83546828f49e678c9b7c627f0abd68c3c89d9cd1ed3f997a6eb4ee0b54a5f&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"“人的因素”促使我们更深刻认识到参与网络安全链条中的人员个体的差异和作用，用新技术去弥补防御方弱点、固化人员安全能力推广、并限制攻击者活动空间。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKLKas3g1eZfiaGjIS0f6ibhtn0fToRMuT8IFhuIVtwb5ZwEm9iajhKEElrYiay69R4MjXiaGUHB1NmAwxQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2020-04-29T21:49:47.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329722:1","title":"创新沙盒，罕见领域分布的背后 - RSAC 2020 (1)","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329722&idx=1&sn=1234096c376f851e5e7a857f4db43a9b&chksm=80ee4ac7b799c3d1164bedb06b8c51f8933eb4976f19a25d0b6c2b0e0f7d4aa957d133bd11c0&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"创新沙盒比赛十强名单公布后，各家报道都纷纷加以分析，指出从榜单构成数目来看，应用安全和SaaS安全占据绝大多数。虽然赛事组织者不满固步自封，努力创新求变，套路明显发生改变也是正常的，但市场趋势真的是应用安全要占据半壁江山吗？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKJfQfDwcy6ic0cVOYu26AEUKvjb7gAqSePgf6DLdLXTaSjM5rTqCicolfQxhtxnWTicFjN0qO78ibpFfw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2020-02-21T04:16:27.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329712:1","title":"下一座圣杯 - 2019","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329712&idx=1&sn=e6afca8b64a906c3091ca206a25aa904&chksm=80ee4acdb799c3db8b1d090a0d70c03489b7e548c0fd9e7d154b72541c3d0b2f2a7fc2e24bab&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"每年的圣杯文章预测两年后初见成功的新安全产品。今年笔者挑选的方向注定是个红海；初创公司要谨慎进入，因为必然会直面大厂发起的凶猛竞争。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKJlx6KwE7KfkwYkeibM4GcvnpesAmb9gFYGy0e2WMRraNgfzWuA2aLnzcZdGvHKmlAXCictGR7000dA%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2019-12-25T01:41:26.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329701:1","title":"有意无意被忽略的「单位经济效益」","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329701&idx=1&sn=f4ba384719aeb04b0ff38b65eb7f9a8e&chksm=80ee4ad8b799c3cef51e12b9b2667de1c9607c4e89acd8c5e4a0a03c9bdb2f502f07e38f2279&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"单位经济效益是个充满争议的话题。有些人对它嗤之以鼻，有些人奉为最高准则。中学生都会计算；投资界大佬也时常挂在嘴边谆谆教诲；而有些创业者听到此问题会倍觉尴尬，常顾左右而言他。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKL4cicIRQy2NRBKj6w5MicFqcYa4EC0E5to88XAuyicw5SoOfe8mIwAdPf5hloMb2LRdCeeUVXbwk4YQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2019-10-20T08:41:35.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329695:1","title":"真真假假的创新 - RSAC2019之三","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329695&idx=1&sn=b1dff26033a3a0200cb0de264d1eda3a&chksm=80ee4ae2b799c3f405fbd2a083a6046594f99ab6af6c13460ced755440984565d9db10fbe991&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"RSAC2019已近余波消散，再回头看看会上的热点，并以此展开写创新，是个不错的选择。无论议题或大厂展台或初创博览，创新处处可见。如果参与者自己未曾留意或根本看不到，从而评论说缺乏创新，那未免大大委屈了此次业界盛会。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKKrwELicjmvRBW1lqWicbYtE7iaXtMhShLTdhPD2W0icUdc3LWOiaOS5GTR6HgEkgKCw57jFvrVhXCzDfg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2019-04-14T07:43:05.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329682:1","title":"创新沙盒，谁会是被收购目标? - RSAC2019之二","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329682&idx=1&sn=395831d289d19303748e5610e6930ab8&chksm=80ee4aefb799c3f9512f4d01e00c9ebc87d228b205ab47ddaa05488b97fb48dfb7aa48d056ef&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"前天，Verizon宣布收购2016年创新沙盒入围公司ProtectWise。上周，PANW以5.6亿美元收","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKJk8LXzTcgN2GOR0hekrXAdNW5Lia8eelzyuLWDNicqUH9OjU3D2JSaJqxFlFtgzgibvIfKAo86yp1Qw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2019-03-04T03:38:25.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329677:1","title":"创新沙盒，由开源商业模式说起 - RSAC2019之一","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329677&idx=1&sn=4badc261d9ee546aefa06e0b63ad9de4&chksm=80ee4af0b799c3e6630b058eaa1e362e3c1f3ee781a5a81232eba649819d6fb0bd6008a332d4&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"创新沙盒评论愈发难写，介绍入围者的文章多到汗牛充栋，读者并不感冒浅尝即止的内容，堆砌华丽词藻更会被嗤之以鼻，亟需找到一些独特的角度才能满足眼界变高的读者们的胃口：抛弃吹捧，透过花哨探究本质，试图不放过产品和业务的弱点。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKJ4UYRofaUkS7HxxVicarznRJkBstfUnsKtRIozocvwLicDDbibncIUOWoyMdV362rpds0cyjS4AUO8Q%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2019-02-26T01:07:16.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAwNjA3MzEwNg%3D%3D:2651329670:1","title":"EDR检测持久化Persistence入门","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjA3MzEwNg==&mid=2651329670&idx=1&sn=4b18dc91bffffd3f08f8f908bf09ee8c&chksm=80ee4afbb799c3edfc123362c949d70d14edfacd704ff2501966630ea296fc6d1732116d33c4&scene=126&sessionid=1795095702#rd","description":"随着ATT&CK被广泛认可，识别入侵行为TTPs而不是特征码，已成为新安全产品标配：行为是新控制，是应对高级威胁的关键安全控制，是xDR产品的基础能力。在主机和端点上识别持久化手段的效果明显且较容易入手，是甲方同学应优先考虑获取的能力。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fcic4diaT9moKJEBvBAaQ132v5GnkMINtsGhfSHQQfGD85ycN0kybAH45ScqH7icqnygFDJw8n8jBLYobE6pTv4YcQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2019-02-18T05:09:07.000Z"}]}